    LLM: 'Deal all cards to four players. The player with the two of clubs begins. Players must beat the previous card where possible or pick up cards from the table; individual trump suits create different winning relations for each player. When a player has to take the pile, the next player starts a fresh pile.',
    Player: 'Deal all cards to four players. The player with the two of clubs begins. Players must beat the previous card where possible or pick up cards from the table; individual trump suits create different winning relations for each player. When a player has to take the pile, the next player starts a fresh pile.',
